= Vermont Larner College of Medicine - Prompt 05

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Additional Information
- Limit: 250 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/university-of-vermont-college-of-medicine
- Local notes file: prompt-05.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
Use this space to share any information, not presented elsewhere, that will clarify any aspect of your application. If you are a reapplicant, you may choose to share what you have done since your previous application.

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
- typst/shared/additional-info.typ
- typst/shared/gap-year.typ

#section_label("additional-info backbone")
= Additional Information Backbone

Use this only if it adds real signal.

== Good Uses
- Important context not shown elsewhere
- Meaningful updates
- Clarifying unusual application features

== Avoid
- Repeating your personal statement
- Defensive explanations without insight
- Generic praise for the school
#section_label("gap-year backbone")
= Gap Year / Current Year Backbone

== Timeline
List work, service, research, coursework, and personal commitments in order.

== Purpose
Explain why this year matters for your development, not just what you are doing.

== Connection to Medicine
- Skills built
- Exposure deepened
- Perspective gained

#section_label("School-specific tailoring")
Read `../research.md` and `prompt-05.local.md` before drafting a final version.

